exports[`lib/tap error rendering catalogue > SNAPSHOT_NOT_FOUND 1`] = `
"> cypress tap pin --test-id r7 --command-id 3 --at middle
No snapshot of this command matched that name or index.

Looked for --at "middle". This command has: before, after.

